    <edge source="source:60afe9a659918ddfb1b5faecb7ed146c9c52d0e9b7ab18f808dd84424dc977b1:algorithm:tfidf_logistic_regression" target="source:60afe9a659918ddfb1b5faecb7ed146c9c52d0e9b7ab18f808dd84424dc977b1:task:banking77_intent_classification" id="source:60afe9a659918ddfb1b5faecb7ed146c9c52d0e9b7ab18f808dd84424dc977b1:relation:algorithm_applicable_to_task_tfidf_logistic">
      <data key="d6">APPLICABLE_TO</data>
      <data key="d7">{"head_id":"source:60afe9a659918ddfb1b5faecb7ed146c9c52d0e9b7ab18f808dd84424dc977b1:algorithm:tfidf_logistic_regression","id":"source:60afe9a659918ddfb1b5faecb7ed146c9c52d0e9b7ab18f808dd84424dc977b1:relation:algorithm_applicable_to_task_tfidf_logistic","schema_version":1,"source_id":"source:60afe9a659918ddfb1b5faecb7ed146c9c52d0e9b7ab18f808dd84424dc977b1","source_span":{"end":628,"quote":"TF-IDF + Logistic Regression 属于线性文本分类模型，可以实现上述客服意图分类能力。使用词级一元和二元 TF-IDF、sublinear_tf=True、max_features=30000；LogisticRegression 的 C=4.0、max_iter=500、random_state=42。特征提取与分类器放在同一 Pipeline，适用于上述英文文本多分类任务。","schema_version":1,"start":426},"tail_id":"source:60afe9a659918ddfb1b5faecb7ed146c9c52d0e9b7ab18f808dd84424dc977b1:task:banking77_intent_classification","type":"APPLICABLE_TO"}</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="source:60afe9a659918ddfb1b5faecb7ed146c9c52d0e9b7ab18f808dd84424dc977b1:algorithm:tfidf_logistic_regression" target="source:60afe9a659918ddfb1b5faecb7ed146c9c52d0e9b7ab18f808dd84424dc977b1:capability:intent_classification" id="source:60afe9a659918ddfb1b5faecb7ed146c9c52d0e9b7ab18f808dd84424dc977b1:relation:algorithm_implements_capability_tfidf_logistic">
      <data key="d6">IMPLEMENTS</data>
      <data key="d7">{"head_id":"source:60afe9a659918ddfb1b5faecb7ed146c9c52d0e9b7ab18f808dd84424dc977b1:algorithm:tfidf_logistic_regression","id":"source:60afe9a659918ddfb1b5faecb7ed146c9c52d0e9b7ab18f808dd84424dc977b1:relation:algorithm_implements_capability_tfidf_logistic","schema_version":1,"source_id":"source:60afe9a659918ddfb1b5faecb7ed146c9c52d0e9b7ab18f808dd84424dc977b1","source_span":{"end":628,"quote":"TF-IDF + Logistic Regression 属于线性文本分类模型，可以实现上述客服意图分类能力。使用词级一元和二元 TF-IDF、sublinear_tf=True、max_features=30000；LogisticRegression 的 C=4.0、max_iter=500、random_state=42。特征提取与分类器放在同一 Pipeline，适用于上述英文文本多分类任务。","schema_version":1,"start":426},"tail_id":"source:60afe9a659918ddfb1b5faecb7ed146c9c52d0e9b7ab18f808dd84424dc977b1:capability:intent_classification","type":"IMPLEMENTS"}</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="source:60afe9a659918ddfb1b5faecb7ed146c9c52d0e9b7ab18f808dd84424dc977b1:algorithm:tfidf_multinomialnb" target="source:60afe9a659918ddfb1b5faecb7ed146c9c52d0e9b7ab18f808dd84424dc977b1:task:banking77_intent_classification" id="source:60afe9a659918ddfb1b5faecb7ed146c9c52d0e9b7ab18f808dd84424dc977b1:relation:algorithm_applicable_to_task_tfidf_multinomialnb">
      <data key="d6">APPLICABLE_TO</data>
      <data key="d7">{"head_id":"source:60afe9a659918ddfb1b5faecb7ed146c9c52d0e9b7ab18f808dd84424dc977b1:algorithm:tfidf_multinomialnb","id":"source:60afe9a659918ddfb1b5faecb7ed146c9c52d0e9b7ab18f808dd84424dc977b1:relation:algorithm_applicable_to_task_tfidf_multinomialnb","schema_version":1,"source_id":"source:60afe9a659918ddfb1b5faecb7ed146c9c52d0e9b7ab18f808dd84424dc977b1","source_span":{"end":911,"quote":"TF-IDF + MultinomialNB 属于朴素贝叶斯文本分类模型，可以实现上述客服意图分类能力。使用与线性模型相同的训练集拟合 TF-IDF，特征非负，MultinomialNB 的 alpha=0.1。若验证集指标不达标，最多按预先固定的 alpha=0.05、0.01 尝试优化；不改变数据划分、标签映射或验收门槛。","schema_version":1,"start":747},"tail_id":"source:60afe9a659918ddfb1b5faecb7ed146c9c52d0e9b7ab18f808dd84424dc977b1:task:banking77_intent_classification","type":"APPLICABLE_TO"}</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="source:60afe9a659918ddfb1b5faecb7ed146c9c52d0e9b7ab18f808dd84424dc977b1:algorithm:tfidf_multinomialnb" target="source:60afe9a659918ddfb1b5faecb7ed146c9c52d0e9b7ab18f808dd84424dc977b1:capability:intent_classification" id="source:60afe9a659918ddfb1b5faecb7ed146c9c52d0e9b7ab18f808dd84424dc977b1:relation:algorithm_implements_capability_tfidf_multinomialnb">
      <data key="d6">IMPLEMENTS</data>
      <data key="d7">{"head_id":"source:60afe9a659918ddfb1b5faecb7ed146c9c52d0e9b7ab18f808dd84424dc977b1:algorithm:tfidf_multinomialnb","id":"source:60afe9a659918ddfb1b5faecb7ed146c9c52d0e9b7ab18f808dd84424dc977b1:relation:algorithm_implements_capability_tfidf_multinomialnb","schema_version":1,"source_id":"source:60afe9a659918ddfb1b5faecb7ed146c9c52d0e9b7ab18f808dd84424dc977b1","source_span":{"end":911,"quote":"TF-IDF + MultinomialNB 属于朴素贝叶斯文本分类模型，可以实现上述客服意图分类能力。使用与线性模型相同的训练集拟合 TF-IDF，特征非负，MultinomialNB 的 alpha=0.1。若验证集指标不达标，最多按预先固定的 alpha=0.05、0.01 尝试优化；不改变数据划分、标签映射或验收门槛。","schema_version":1,"start":747},"tail_id":"source:60afe9a659918ddfb1b5faecb7ed146c9c52d0e9b7ab18f808dd84424dc977b1:capability:intent_classification","type":"IMPLEMENTS"}</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="source:60afe9a659918ddfb1b5faecb7ed146c9c52d0e9b7ab18f808dd84424dc977b1:task:banking77_intent_classification" target="source:60afe9a659918ddfb1b5faecb7ed146c9c52d0e9b7ab18f808dd84424dc977b1:capability:intent_classification" id="source:60afe9a659918ddfb1b5faecb7ed146c9c52d0e9b7ab18f808dd84424dc977b1:relation:task_requires_capability">
      <data key="d6">REQUIRES</data>
      <data key="d7">{"head_id":"source:60afe9a659918ddfb1b5faecb7ed146c9c52d0e9b7ab18f808dd84424dc977b1:task:banking77_intent_classification","id":"source:60afe9a659918ddfb1b5faecb7ed146c9c52d0e9b7ab18f808dd84424dc977b1:relation:task_requires_capability","schema_version":1,"source_id":"source:60afe9a659918ddfb1b5faecb7ed146c9c52d0e9b7ab18f808dd84424dc977b1","source_span":{"end":424,"quote":"客服意图分类能力接收英文文本和训练标签，输出意图类别及按固定类别顺序排列的概率。适用条件是有监督标签的文本多分类。使用固定数据版本与类别映射；仅在训练集拟合词表和 IDF。评价指标为 Macro-F1 与 Accuracy，同时报告逐类 Precision/Recall/F1 和混淆矩阵；阈值通过训练/验证基线校准并在最终测试前冻结。","schema_version":1,"start":256},"tail_id":"source:60afe9a659918ddfb1b5faecb7ed146c9c52d0e9b7ab18f808dd84424dc977b1:capability:intent_classification","type":"REQUIRES"}</data>
    </edge>
